  aciklama:
  - "Fal\u0131n \xE7ok \xF6nemli baz\u0131 bulgularla a\xE7\u0131l\u0131yor {{isim}}.
    Bir ka\u011F\u0131t kalemle baz\u0131 \u015F\u0131k giyimli insanlar\u0131n aras\u0131nda
    dola\u015F\u0131p, onlardan adeta imza topluyorsun. Bence devlet memuru olmana
    ra\u011Fmen, sende \xE7ok b\xFCy\xFCk bir \"giri\u015Fimci kafas\u0131\" var.
    Bundan {{yil_+3}} y\u0131l sonra, \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131n sekt\xF6r\xFCn
    d\u0131\u015F\u0131nda bir noktada, akl\u0131nda y\u0131llard\u0131r var olan
    i\u015F fikirlerinden birini uygulayacaks\u0131n. Deste\u011Fini alaca\u011F\u0131n,
    sermaye sa\u011Flayaca\u011F\u0131n ya da ortakl\u0131k edece\u011Fin ki\u015Filer
    g\xF6r\xFCyorum. Sana \u015F\xF6yle s\xF6yleyeyim {{isim}}; bu i\u015Fi hayata
    ge\xE7irmeye ba\u015Flad\u0131\u011F\u0131nda, {{kelime, bir | iki | \xFC\xE7}}
    haftadan k\u0131sa bir s\xFCrede \u015Fu anki ayl\u0131k gelirinin yakla\u015F\u0131k
    {{sayi,4,9}} kat\u0131n\u0131 kazanma imkan\u0131 bulacaks\u0131n."
